# Local dev stub: a copy of GET /api/getResume so `npm start` renders real
# content without a backend. Never commit it.
public/getResume
# The same dev-stub trick for the save history: `npm start` serves public/ at
# the root, so a file here answers GET /backups with no API running. Ignored for
# the same reason getResume is -- it is scratch data, not the contract.
public/backups
